{"parentUuid":"9a611c25-473c-40fa-9a06-f3717534b8e5","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01SBoh36RjTgSJfFJp24WanU","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"0d646dbe-17e1-4586-97b2-1ca47eba6079","timestamp":"2026-10-26T04:06:50.313Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
{"parentUuid":"0d646dbe-17e1-4586-97b2-1ca47eba6079","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQBuGMWrTpC4BEKAavnw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm working through the Escape key handling conflict between ItemView's capture-phase window listener and the action menu popup — I need ItemView to skip closing when the event target is inside the menu, while the popup itself handles Escape/Tab with stopPropagation so it closes and returns focus to the trigger, similar to the LicenseFilter pattern.\n\nComparing against old behavior: Base UI's modal=false mode already handles outside-click dismissal and aria-expanded/aria-haspopup attributes correctly, matching the old implementation's conditional rendering based on whether spaces exist. For the popup's enter animation I'm matching the old fade/translate timing with Base UI's data-starting-style classes, and since the old menu had no exit animation, letting removal happen immediately without ending-style classes should be fine. Now I'm working out the positioning to replicate the old absolute bottom offset.\n\nWorking through the trigger's vertical position inside the 44px footer to recompute the sideOffset needed for pixel parity with the old layout, landing on roughly 12-13px instead of the original 6px due to the trigger not being flush with the footer edge.\n\nSince the menu opens inside a scrollable inspector body with overflow hidden, I'm confirming it should still flow upward as before without clipping issues.\n\nI'm mapping the old fieldset/legend markup onto Menu.Group and GroupLabel, deciding whether to add an aria-label since Base UI likely handles labelling via aria-labelledby on the trigger automatically. I'm also converting the floated title styling into a simple block element with padding, and comparing the old option's padding and gap values against the current menu item styles to spot small spacing mismatches that need reconciling.\n\nI want a custom class instead of reusing MENU_ITEM since padding differs. For focus handling, menu items have tabindex -1, so they'd match the global `[tabindex]:focus-visible` outline rule, but MENU_ITEM also sets outline-none, so I need to check index.css to see which rule actually wins.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2339,"cache_read_input_tokens":119016,"output_tokens":1496,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1354},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2339,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1496,"cache_read_input_tokens":119016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2339,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2339},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":17481,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgQBuFoHPkFCy9zcGNyqQ","requestRef":"9cd3b259-df33-4dc2-bab6-b748ba0c14ee","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ff0acba1-274e-4108-be4d-169520692eca","timestamp":"2026-10-26T04:06:50.312Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
