{"parentUuid":"85d0b11e-d68c-4823-9a21-a2fb4e0b8b4d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQWga9CqKMgsSZc5YKcU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm trying to figure out which element's box-shadow is relevant at rest versus after zooming, checking whether the selector targets the lens image or the frame image, and tracing whether the zoom state persists after zooming out twice.\n\nOn the base version, I notice a real bug: pressing Escape while the Space menu is open closes the entire item view rather than just the menu, because both listeners fire on the window's capture phase and the overlay's listener (mounted earlier) runs first. My version fixes this by closing only the menu, which actually aligns with what the original code comment intended, so I should flag this as a bug fix in the PR rather than a parity break. I'll move on to running the branch now.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1200,"cache_read_input_tokens":211581,"output_tokens":554,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":392},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1200,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":554,"cache_read_input_tokens":211581,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1200,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1200},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6753,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgQWgZmNkmCETZQgzAXTE","requestRef":"d948fad0-b79c-40d6-a25c-838020ac81fb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"663eab9f-2ea3-4