{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","hash":"614b49dc212416958b053890376d9b73061bebefeb6055e38a691d49239f0f07","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The space menu diff shows the branch version highlighting the first menu item with a focus outline while the base version has no focused item at all—most other differences are minor mascot shifts. I should write a small bounding-box helper script that groups pixel diffs into 40px grid cells to help pinpoint where clusters of changes occur, since squ129 doesn't seem to have one already.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Abc4x9JaQ3rHkeWst7knPn","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8\\.cells.tmp.mjs","content":"import sharp from \"sharp\";\nconst [a, b] = process.argv.slice(2);\nconst A = await sharp(a).ensureAlpha().raw().toBuffer({ resolveWithObject: true });\nconst B = await sharp(b).ensureAlpha().raw().toBuffer({ resolveWithObject: true });\nconst { width, height } = A.info;\nconst cell = 40;\nconst cells = new Map();\nfor (let y = 0; y < height; y++)\n  for (let x = 0; x < width; x++) {\n    const i = (y * width + x) * 4;\n    let d = 0;\n    for (let k = 0; k < 3; k++) d = Math.max(d, Math.abs(A.data[i + k] - B.data[i + k]));\n    if (d > 8) {\n      const key = `${Math.floor(x / cell) * cell},${Math.floor(y / cell) * cell}`;\n      cells.set(key, (cells.get(key) ?? 0) + 1);\n    }\n  }\nconsole.log([...cells].sort((p, q) => q[1] - p[1]).slice(0, 12).map(([k, n]) => `${k}:${n}`).join(\"  \"));\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014j4ir6QUSxcqenUQz1zhEe","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-a1f541e8 && T=/c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/squ131; for n in image-info video-info image-space-menu note-focus pdf-info quote-info; do echo \"$n: $(bun .cells.tmp.mjs $T/before/$n.png $T/after/$n.png)\"; done","description":"Locate pixel diff regions"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
