{"parentUuid":"d785b9d7-2908-4ed7-b276-7e16397ee3bb","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14919427 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"229e151e-9d13-498a-968f-cfa2fc03c997","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:15:13.120Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14919427 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","hash":"e6249dd5a398fa448fd4a27116f440e78bf545ec43c71758bb05656f2a7fca42","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The positions line up well, and the branch highlighting mirrors keyboard-style selection without an unwanted focus outline, matching LicenseFilter's behavior. I'm also noting the seed text has extra spaces that don't affect what's rendered, and planning to double-check the hover states on tiles next.\n\nTrying to pixel-compare mid-flight animation states is tricky since I can't easily pause GSAP's global timeline, so instead I'll verify the computed styles directly during flight — checking that the stage has zero inset, the inspector opacity drops to 0, and the image's box-shadow disappears while the data-flying attribute is active, timing the check to land within that brief 0.4s window on both base and branch.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Menu geometry matches exactly; the branch just opens with the first item highlighted (same as SQU-130's menus). Now checking mid-flight styles on both builds:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Y1H1rCCfyUxpVcVjxoX72o","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\squ131\\flight.ts","content":"import { connect } from \"../squ129/cdp\";\nconst [url] = process.argv.slice(2);\nconst c = await connect(\"9400\", \"\", url);\nawait c.send(\"Page.bringToFront\");\nawait c.send(\"Emulation.setFocusEmulationEnabled\", { enabled: true });\nawait c.send(\"Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride\", { width: 1280, height: 800, deviceScaleFactor: 1, mobile: false });\nconst probe = `(() => {\n  const s = document.querySelector(\".expanded-overlay\");\n  if (!s) return null;\n  const stage = s.firstElementChild, insp = s.children[1];\n  const img = stage.querySelector(\"img\");\n  const cs = (e) => getComputedStyle(e);\n  return { flying: s.className.includes(\"is-flying\") || s.hasAttribute(\"data-flying\"), stageInset: cs(stage).inset, stagePad: cs(stage).padding, stageBorder: cs(stage).borderColor, stageRadius: cs(stage).borderRadius, inspOpacity: cs(insp).opacity, inspTranslate: cs(insp).translate, imgShadow: img && cs(img).boxShadow, pill: (() => { const p = s.querySelector(\".glass\"); return p && cs(p).opacity; })() };\n})()`;\nconst card = `document.querySelector('.library-card[data-library-item-id=\"me-optimus\"]')`;\nawait c.ev(`${card}.focus(); true`);\nawait c.key(\"Enter\");\nconst mid = await c.ev(probe);\nawait c.until(`document.activeElement?.getAttribute(\"aria-label\") === \"Close details\"`);\nawait c.ev(`new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 600))`);\nconst rest = await c.ev(probe);\nawait c.key(\"Escape\");\nconst closing = await c.ev(probe);\nawait c.until(`!document.querySelector(\".expanded-overlay\")`);\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({ mid, rest, closing }, null, 1));\nc.close();\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019vbhcsmMUJN3cgBD4ArTSL","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/squ131 && timeout 60 bun flight.ts http://localhost:58561/ > flight-base.json; timeout 60 bun flight.ts http://localhost:58562/ > flight-branch.json; diff flight-base.json flight-branch.json && echo SAME; cat flight-branch.json","description":"Compare mid-flight computed styles"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
